WEBVTT

00:17:29.616 --> 00:17:32.195
i možda završi na farmi poput moje žene."

00:17:32.195 --> 00:17:33.324
Tako da znaju kakvu razliku

00:17:33.324 --> 00:17:34.349
može napraviti obrazovanje,

00:17:34.349 --> 00:17:37.346
na jedan velik, dubok način.

00:17:37.346 --> 00:17:38.767
CA: Mislim, ovo je još jedna slika

00:17:38.767 --> 00:17:42.173
vaše druge dvoje djece, Rory i Phoebe

00:17:42.173 --> 00:17:46.311
zajedno sa Paulom Farmerom.

00:17:46.311 --> 00:17:47.925
Odgajati troje djece

00:17:47.925 --> 00:17:50.927
kada ste najbogatija obitelj na svijetu

00:17:50.927 --> 00:17:53.223
čini se kao društveni eksperiment

00:17:53.223 --> 00:17:56.795
bez ikakvih osnova.

00:17:56.795 --> 00:17:58.330
Kako ste to napravili?

00:17:58.330 --> 00:18:00.545
Koji je bio vaš pristup?